# Serve exactly what was committed. These are shipped to a browser, and a
# line-ending rewrite on checkout would change bytes nobody inspected.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Three source files use literal NUL bytes as cache-key and sentinel
# separators. Git already detects them as binary; saying so is insurance
# against a future setting deciding to "normalize" them.
*.png binary
vendor/pdfjs/build/* binary
